# The Class accessors are temporary seams: their bodies are on the free
# path, verified with it.
Class::size	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::slab_size	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::nslots	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::compact_slots	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::slab_bits	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::slabs_per_line	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::slot_of_offset	allocator invariant	Verus
Class::slab_mask	allocator invariant	Verus
ClassTable	UnsafeCell/volatile/transmute	none (assumption)
